{"text":"孝昌二年五月十五日，清信欲會為亡女比丘尼法明、一切含識，敬造觀世音像一軀。願登紫極，永與苦別。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"欲會","refId":null,"text":"欲會","start":12,"end":14},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法明","refId":null,"text":"法明","start":20,"end":22},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含識","start":25,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"觀世音","refId":null,"text":"觀世音","start":30,"end":33},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"紫微","refId":null,"text":"紫極","start":39,"end":41}]}